      f

         inoculum


 = fraction of TC in the inoculum;



      f

         buffer


= fraction of TC in the buffer;



      f

         additives


= fraction of TC in the additives (i.e. sum of the inoculum and buffer fractions);



      f

         substrate


= fraction of TC in the substrate (i.e. raw, pretreated, saccharified duckweed, or the residues of the previous bioprocess) initially fed to a given bioprocess;
